## Step 5 — Loading the Generated Suite

The `GreatExpectationsRunner` resolves suites relative to the installed `agoradatatools` package. With
the editable install from `python-env.mdc` (`pip install -e ".[dev]"`), the installed package points
at your source tree, so the suite you just generated is loaded directly — **no reinstall needed**.

If instead you did a non-editable `pip install .`, the runner loads suites from the copy in
`site-packages`, so you must re-run `pip install .` after generating the suite, or it will log:
> `Expectation suite <transform> does not exist. Data validation will not be performed.`

